                                          "type": "object"
                                        },
                                        "pvcTolerateLessSpaceUpToPercent": {
                                          "description": "LessPVCSpaceToleration determines how much smaller, in percentage, disk PVCs are\nallowed to be compared to the requested size (to account for various overheads).\nDefaults to 10",
