                                          "description": "MaxGuest defines the maximum amount memory that can be allocated\nto the guest using hotplug.",
                                          "pattern": "^(\\+|-)?(([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?)|(\\.[0-9]+))(([KMGTPE]i)|[numkMGTPE]|([eE](\\+|-)?(([0-9]+(\\.[0-9]*)?)|(\\.[0-9]+))))?$",
